	category = "dogroth caldera",
	name = _t"tattered paper scrap",
	lore = _t[[I fell into a trance, I know not how. Were it the rich blossoms or the oppressive heat? I swooned into the grass and the mists swirled over my face, playing out fantastic shapes before my eyes. Dancing ladies strode across the skies, and a row of dwarves stood laughing as their beards flew into the wind. Then I felt a Shadow near, and the ladies scattered and the dwarves in terror screamed, their mouths yowling and spilling black petals. I tried to move, but I couldn't, and frozen in fear I saw the Shadow above me, looking down upon my countenance. It grunted and lurched away. I passed out then, and have just recovered.

I am not sure what to make of this. I wish to leave, but I do not know the way. Only by escaping this mist shall I have a clear view of the land. Yet each path seems to wind unexpected, each step takes me closer to the centre, not further. I must make haste from this place.
]],
}

